    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1803">

                <pb facs="1180" n="1064" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1064"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 823.00/135.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister McMillin to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Lima</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-03-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 2, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Effort to convoke Congress yesterday failed for want of quorum in both Houses,
                    anti-Leguia elements thus manifesting opposition to his reappointment. The Junta
                    expects to call extra session about March 11.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McMillin</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
